# Create Parallel Way (Tools menu): a copy of the selected way offset to one
# side, asked for in a dialog.
#
# Coordinate model: the viewport center is at window (488, 388) — see
# select.osmscript for the derivation. fixtures/parallel-way.osm is laid out
# in window coordinates at zoom 18 (about 0.45 m per pixel), centered on
# (40.7120, -74.0060):
#   A  way 6101  a road with two 45 degree bends, (250,250) .. (750,350)
#   B  way 6102  a hairpin: (250,500) -> (550,500) -> (300,540)
#   C  way 6201  a closed fence drawn clockwise, (700,120) .. (850,230)

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/parallel-way.osm
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 18
wait_idle 5s
capture out/parallel-01-start.png

# Select the road and ask for a parallel way. The dialog starts at 5 m; the
# offset is replaced with -15 (left of the direction of travel, so north).
click 350,250
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected way 6101
capture out/parallel-02-selected.png
action selection::RunSelectionAction {"id":"parallel"}
wait_idle 2s
capture out/parallel-03-dialog.png
key backspace
type -15
wait_idle 1s
capture out/parallel-04-dialog-filled.png
key enter
wait_idle 2s
assert_status_contains Created 1 parallel way
assert_selected_count 1
assert_pending 5
capture out/parallel-05-created.png

# One undo step removes the copy and its nodes; redo brings it back.
key cmd+z
wait_idle 2s
assert_pending 0
capture out/parallel-06-undone.png
key cmd+shift+z
wait_idle 2s
assert_pending 5
capture out/parallel-07-redone.png

# The hairpin: the dialog offers the last value (-15). On the outside of the
# turn the miter would be far too long, so the corner is bevelled.
click 400,500
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected way 6102
action selection::RunSelectionAction {"id":"parallel"}
wait_idle 2s
capture out/parallel-08-dialog-remembers.png
key enter
wait_idle 2s
assert_status_contains Created 1 parallel way
assert_pending 10
capture out/parallel-09-hairpin.png

# The closed fence gets a closed ring: with -15 on a clockwise ring, outside.
click 775,120
wait_idle 2s
assert_selected way 6201
action selection::RunSelectionAction {"id":"parallel"}
wait_idle 2s
key enter
wait_idle 2s
assert_status_contains Created 1 parallel way
assert_pending 15
capture out/parallel-10-ring.png

log done
